WEBVTT

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
aozameta machinami yureru boku no kage

00:08.690 --> 00:16.160
The pale street, my swaying shadow,

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
nibui ashidori wa yuku saki wo shirazu

00:16.160 --> 00:24.440
I walk slowly, not knowing my destination.

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
kawasenu omoi

00:24.440 --> 00:30.480
My feelings can't reach yours.

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
kimi no hitomi no naka utsushidasu mono wo

00:31.240 --> 00:38.620
The things reflected in the depths of your eyes,

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
uketomeru tame ni hashiridashiteita

00:38.620 --> 00:46.860
I started running in order to catch up to them.

00:46.860 --> 01:00.640
sashidasu sono te wo hodokerai youni nigirikaesu

00:46.860 --> 01:00.640
I grip your outstretched hand without letting go.

01:01.170 --> 01:08.680
hanbun no tsuki no yoru wa bokura wo terashite

01:01.170 --> 01:08.680
On this night, the half moon shines upon us.

01:08.680 --> 01:15.990
oikaketekita jikan wo boku wa furikitte

01:08.680 --> 01:15.990
I shake off the flow of time chasing after us.

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
hanbun zutsu no bokura wa egaku saki made mo mieru

01:16.220 --> 01:27.430
We're half of ourselves, but we can draw the future.

01:44.780 --> 01:45.450
Don't bother us!

01:45.920 --> 01:46.850
Get out of here!

01:47.220 --> 01:48.690
Why don't you wait outside?

01:48.690 --> 01:50.960
I'll let you know if anything happens.

01:51.490 --> 01:52.690
If anything happens...

01:54.990 --> 01:56.560
What do you think will happen?

01:57.200 --> 02:01.900
One Stopped Minute

02:07.310 --> 02:08.340
Rika...

02:11.380 --> 02:13.340
What happened to Rika?

02:13.340 --> 02:15.110
She's temporarily stable.

02:15.650 --> 02:18.050
She didn't have such a bad relapse for quite some time now...

02:19.720 --> 02:20.920
So she's safe?

02:21.450 --> 02:22.420
I guess...

02:23.990 --> 02:26.890
Ezaki, why did you stay here?

02:28.260 --> 02:31.160
Why did a person like you stay here?

02:31.930 --> 02:34.000
Do you intentionally want people to hate you?

02:34.000 --> 02:35.000
Hey!

02:35.000 --> 02:36.800
Do you?!

02:43.140 --> 02:44.410
Rika's condition...

02:44.840 --> 02:45.910
How is it?

02:47.010 --> 02:50.520
Note: Akiba Rika - No Visitors

02:47.480 --> 02:48.980
There hasn't been any improvement.

02:49.310 --> 02:50.510
I see.

02:50.520 --> 02:54.020
Note: No Visitors

02:50.820 --> 02:51.550
Yeah.

02:51.550 --> 02:53.680
The operation probably has to be delayed.

02:54.420 --> 02:55.920
36.6 degrees.

02:55.920 --> 02:57.490
No problem.

03:02.590 --> 03:03.590
Yuuichi!

03:05.660 --> 03:07.100
Come with me for a bit.

03:19.680 --> 03:21.480
I said I'd quit smoking...

03:22.080 --> 03:24.210
Why did you give me a lighter, Sayoko?

03:36.530 --> 03:38.160
Hello, this is Natsume.

03:38.160 --> 03:39.000
It's me.

03:39.400 --> 03:41.470
Yahoo, it's Goro-kun.

03:41.470 --> 03:43.530
Sayoko, were you asleep?

03:44.600 --> 03:47.710
Spring is too warm, so I can't help it.

03:48.410 --> 03:51.010
Your husband is hard at work,

03:51.010 --> 03:54.550
and you're so carefree that you sleep in in the mornings... What a nice wife.

03:55.080 --> 03:59.720
So who's the one preparing dinner for you?

03:59.720 --> 04:02.550
And why is the room always so clean?

04:03.090 --> 04:06.090
Because there's a fairy helping quietly in the background.

04:06.090 --> 04:08.660
That fairy sure is incredible.

04:08.660 --> 04:10.290
Really incredible.

04:10.630 --> 04:11.730
I wonder.

04:11.730 --> 04:15.570
And I've heard she's really cute.

04:24.640 --> 04:27.450
Why, Sayoko?

04:27.450 --> 04:31.680
Note: Akiba Rika

04:27.980 --> 04:29.310
One minute.

04:29.310 --> 04:31.680
I can only stop one minute for you.

04:31.680 --> 04:37.360
Note: Akiba Rika - No Visitors

04:31.980 --> 04:33.120
Stop?

04:33.120 --> 04:35.590
If someone finds out, I'll be in trouble too.

04:35.590 --> 04:36.590
Alright, hurry!

04:36.590 --> 04:37.960
Ah, yes.

04:45.160 --> 04:47.530
Yuuichi, you came.

04:48.030 --> 04:52.000
Yeah, Akiko-san is letting me stay for a minute.

04:52.370 --> 04:53.870
That's so short, eh?

04:53.870 --> 04:54.940
One minute...

04:56.340 --> 04:57.510
That's true.

04:58.480 --> 05:00.380
But, I'm glad.

05:19.800 --> 05:22.130
The time is up...

05:23.000 --> 05:23.630
Yeah.

05:24.140 --> 05:26.100
See you later, Yuuichi.

05:27.570 --> 05:28.210
Yeah.

05:35.510 --> 05:39.350
Hurry up and go, or Tanizaki-san will get in trouble.

05:40.120 --> 05:41.020
Okay...

05:55.770 --> 05:57.440
Doctor, here is...

05:57.440 --> 05:58.940
It's cigarette-shaped chocolate.

05:58.940 --> 05:59.900
Yeah, yeah...

05:59.900 --> 06:01.740
Please don't smoke here.

06:06.740 --> 06:09.650
I'll be back in during the weekend just as planned.

06:10.520 --> 06:13.020
Ah, there's only about a minute left.

06:13.020 --> 06:14.690
One minute, huh?

06:14.690 --> 06:18.160
But if you put in another 10 yen, you can talk longer.

06:18.520 --> 06:19.660
I see.

06:20.120 --> 06:22.460
I know you're busy.

06:22.460 --> 06:26.130
After all, you are a doctor.

06:28.770 --> 06:29.730
What is it?

06:30.170 --> 06:31.270
Goro-kun...

06:32.270 --> 06:33.440
What is it, Sayoko?

06:33.440 --> 06:36.070
My heart is beating really fast...

06:37.310 --> 06:38.210
Huh?

06:38.210 --> 06:40.610
I feel strange...

06:47.650 --> 06:48.990
That was close...

06:49.590 --> 06:50.390
Yeah...

06:51.260 --> 06:52.890
Your wife's heart...

06:52.890 --> 06:54.430
isn't too good.

06:54.430 --> 06:55.490
Yeah.

06:55.490 --> 06:58.330
This relapse isn't too serious...

06:58.330 --> 07:02.270
But I'm afraid a complete recovery is difficult.

07:02.270 --> 07:03.370
I understand.

07:04.140 --> 07:06.100
Cherish her as much as you can.

07:06.840 --> 07:07.870
Do you understand?

07:08.340 --> 07:09.170
Yes.

07:12.180 --> 07:13.080
Doctor!

07:14.650 --> 07:15.910
I said it's cigarette-shaped chocolate.

07:15.910 --> 07:17.420
It doesn't look like it.

07:20.150 --> 07:21.650
Honestly...

07:21.650 --> 07:24.260
Ah, no... I messed them up by accident.

07:36.700 --> 07:37.800
It's so heavy.

07:41.510 --> 07:43.980
Note: Wakaba Municipal Hospital

07:46.110 --> 07:50.780
Note: Rent-a-cycle Bank Repair - Evergreen Cycle

08:11.800 --> 08:15.470
It'll be great if I can go somewhere far away.

08:16.510 --> 08:17.840
Yuuichi-kun?

08:20.080 --> 08:21.610
Yuuichi-kun, right?

08:22.550 --> 08:24.520
Misako-san...

08:29.520 --> 08:31.160
Yo, Tanizaki.

08:31.160 --> 08:31.990
Huh?

08:35.590 --> 08:37.100
Doctor.

08:37.100 --> 08:40.300
It'll be fine if you take a short break.

08:41.430 --> 08:42.870
I just woke up.

08:42.870 --> 08:45.700
Ah, that's too bad.

08:45.700 --> 08:47.370
Stop that attitude.

08:47.370 --> 08:52.010
But we're a doctor and a nurse...

08:53.080 --> 08:54.080
What do you think you're doing?

08:54.080 --> 08:56.250
You're the one who wanted a fight.

08:56.250 --> 08:59.020
Huh? I was just talking.

08:59.020 --> 09:00.720
You sure are funny.

09:00.720 --> 09:01.790
I can't stop laughing.

09:01.790 --> 09:03.320
You too.

09:03.990 --> 09:05.660
Sorry for the wait.

09:06.390 --> 09:09.630
I've brought back the combo special!

09:10.560 --> 09:15.270
Ah, Senpai, did Ezaki-kun sneak out again?

09:15.270 --> 09:16.930
Huh? Why do you ask?

09:16.930 --> 09:18.900
When I was on the 23rd street,

09:18.900 --> 09:22.610
I saw a person that looked a lot like him in an imported car.

09:22.610 --> 09:23.810
Imported car?

09:23.810 --> 09:25.610
I probably made a mistake.

09:25.610 --> 09:28.180
The driver was a woman too.

09:31.620 --> 09:32.880
The hospital...

09:32.880 --> 09:34.450
Is it okay to sneak out?

09:34.820 --> 09:35.790
It's not allowed.

09:37.090 --> 09:38.360
Then it's not okay.

09:38.360 --> 09:40.220
Will Akiko be angry?

09:40.220 --> 09:42.160
She'll be really angry.

09:42.160 --> 09:44.090
She's scary, isn't she?

09:44.600 --> 09:47.930
I've gotten punished by her three times before too.

09:47.930 --> 09:48.900
Really?

09:48.900 --> 09:49.870
Yeah.

09:49.870 --> 09:51.140
And she was serious.

09:51.140 --> 09:52.740
My whole body went flying.

09:54.140 --> 09:56.270
She'll probably be angry again if she finds out.

09:56.270 --> 09:57.080
Yeah.

09:57.480 --> 09:58.580
Want to run away?

09:58.840 --> 09:59.480
Huh?

10:01.150 --> 10:02.350
I was kidding.

10:02.910 --> 10:04.920
I just wanted to go home for a bit.

10:05.680 --> 10:06.620
Home?

10:06.620 --> 10:07.450
Yeah.

10:07.890 --> 10:09.290
Just for a bit.

10:12.260 --> 10:13.790
Please lock the door.

10:20.630 --> 10:22.030
Sorry to bother you.

10:23.940 --> 10:26.770
Yuuichi-kun, you are heading to university, right?

10:27.270 --> 10:28.540
Yeah...

10:28.540 --> 10:29.440
In Tokyo?

10:30.140 --> 10:33.040
I don't know yet...

10:33.040 --> 10:33.810
Probably...

10:34.410 --> 10:37.620
I went to Tokyo before,

10:37.620 --> 10:39.220
as a model.

10:39.220 --> 10:40.250
Model?

10:40.790 --> 10:41.920
Yeah...

10:41.920 --> 10:45.560
but my father got sick, so I came back.

10:45.990 --> 10:50.030
I'm the only child, so I have to take care of him.

11:25.160 --> 11:27.900
There's too many boring things going on...

11:29.400 --> 11:32.300
but it can't be helped.

11:33.400 --> 11:37.140
No one will come and comfort me.

11:38.980 --> 11:41.010
I envy you.

11:42.810 --> 11:46.180
I really hated this city.

11:47.620 --> 11:49.320
I still do.

11:50.360 --> 11:52.190
You can understand, right?

11:54.430 --> 11:56.530
I really hate it.

12:01.300 --> 12:04.600
Misako! Come out!

12:04.600 --> 12:06.500
Akiko-san?

12:04.600 --> 12:06.500
You hear me, don't you?!

12:06.500 --> 12:09.370
Her intuition has always been this good.

12:06.500 --> 12:08.770
Hey, Misako!

12:09.370 --> 12:10.880
What should we do?

12:09.370 --> 12:12.680
Geez, Misako!

12:10.880 --> 12:12.680
The door is locked.

12:12.680 --> 12:15.580
Seriously, causing me so much trouble.

12:13.280 --> 12:14.410
Do you want to continue?

12:15.580 --> 12:19.120
I know you're in there, Misako!

12:16.910 --> 12:19.120
Ah, too bad.

12:20.150 --> 12:21.350
Yuuichi!

12:26.490 --> 12:28.690
Ezaki, we're going back.

12:55.420 --> 12:57.490
You'd better not say anything, brat.

12:58.560 --> 13:04.400
There are a lot of people who try to think of an excuse and ended up admitting everything.

13:04.400 --> 13:07.030
That is even worse for a girl.

13:07.030 --> 13:09.600
If you want to lie to her, lie to her until the end.

13:10.440 --> 13:11.700
If you let Rika know...

13:11.700 --> 13:13.670
I will kill you!

13:14.410 --> 13:15.440
Answer me!

13:15.870 --> 13:17.110
Yes...

13:20.550 --> 13:24.950
I thought you would be more of the honest kind.

13:25.580 --> 13:27.450
I'm not...

13:27.450 --> 13:31.120
But I can tell that you're really loyal to your wife.

13:31.420 --> 13:32.360
I guess.

13:32.360 --> 13:33.930
Then why?

13:34.530 --> 13:37.200
It's too heavy for me.

13:40.630 --> 13:41.870
Don't go crazy.

13:42.700 --> 13:43.530
I'm sorry.

13:56.680 --> 13:57.850
Take a seat.

14:02.950 --> 14:04.860
Yesterday was close, eh?

14:07.490 --> 14:10.960
I don't care what you do.

14:10.960 --> 14:14.200
But you have to uphold your promise to Tanizaki.

14:14.730 --> 14:16.600
Don't let Rika know...

14:16.600 --> 14:18.740
It would definitely have a negative effect on her body.

14:19.340 --> 14:20.540
I know.

14:20.540 --> 14:23.040
Liar. I don't think you understand.

14:23.980 --> 14:25.840
Why did it have to be you?

14:26.180 --> 14:27.210
Huh?

14:27.210 --> 14:28.250
It's nothing.

14:31.680 --> 14:33.180
What are you doing?

14:33.690 --> 14:35.090
Finger-reflex training.

14:36.190 --> 14:39.060
Rika said she wants the operation.

14:40.090 --> 14:42.560
The last relapse was too serious...

14:42.860 --> 14:44.830
I was thinking of delaying the operation.

14:45.260 --> 14:48.670
But if we delay it any further, there will be the risk of further deterioration.

14:48.670 --> 14:53.810
In this kind of contradictory situation, even a specialist like me is hard-pressed at making a decision.

14:55.910 --> 15:01.880
I let Rika's mother make the decision and she went to ask Rika what she thinks.

15:02.850 --> 15:05.820
Rika decided to have the operation.

15:05.820 --> 15:07.650
Because she wants to live.

15:09.390 --> 15:12.190
I've been taking care of her since she was in elementary school.

15:12.720 --> 15:14.630
Her personality has always been like that...

15:14.630 --> 15:16.790
She looks like she's strong, but is actually really weak inside.

15:16.790 --> 15:18.400
A stubborn kid.

15:20.970 --> 15:23.670
I had always been bullied by her too.

15:24.240 --> 15:27.810
This is my first time hearing her say that she wants to live.

15:29.410 --> 15:30.910
My first time hearing it...

15:36.810 --> 15:38.380
This is a nice camera.

15:41.520 --> 15:42.420
Huh?

15:42.420 --> 15:43.620
What's this?

15:43.620 --> 15:44.790
The film is stuck.

15:44.790 --> 15:46.460
No way.

15:49.230 --> 15:51.130
Did you put the film in properly?

15:51.130 --> 15:52.260
Of course I did.

15:52.260 --> 15:55.330
Liar. You probably put it in wrong.

15:55.330 --> 15:57.270
If you didn't put it in right in the beginning,

15:57.270 --> 16:00.240
it'll turn out like this, with the film stuck in the middle.

16:01.210 --> 16:02.410
Don't tell me...

16:03.040 --> 16:04.710
Ezaki-kun!

16:05.140 --> 16:07.080
You have a guest!

16:08.350 --> 16:09.410
What's this?

16:09.410 --> 16:10.520
It's Miyuki.

16:10.520 --> 16:12.780
Please give those to that girl.

16:12.780 --> 16:14.390
These are school uniforms.

16:14.390 --> 16:15.620
Is it okay?

16:15.620 --> 16:17.760
My sister doesn't need them anymore...

16:17.760 --> 16:20.330
And the size fits that girl really well.

16:20.330 --> 16:21.830
Did Rika ask for those?

16:21.830 --> 16:22.530
No...

16:23.130 --> 16:24.260
Then why?

16:25.500 --> 16:26.760
Because...

16:31.170 --> 16:32.800
Huh? Is it okay?

16:32.800 --> 16:34.110
Of course.

16:34.570 --> 16:37.540
You haven't tried the summer uniform yet, right?

16:37.540 --> 16:38.510
Yeah.

16:38.510 --> 16:40.450
You can try it on when you feel better.

16:40.950 --> 16:42.010
Pervert.

16:42.010 --> 16:43.180
Huh?

16:43.180 --> 16:45.920
You looked like one for a moment.

16:45.920 --> 16:48.150
I'm not. It's not like that...

16:51.060 --> 16:52.220
Yuuichi.

16:52.220 --> 16:55.330
Are those pictures, we took last time, developed yet?

16:56.390 --> 16:57.630
Umm...

16:58.660 --> 17:01.230
I'm thinking of developing them soon.

17:01.700 --> 17:02.900
I'll let you see them when they're done.

17:04.140 --> 17:05.500
You can do that later.

17:07.570 --> 17:09.440
I'll look at them after the operation.

17:14.910 --> 17:15.680
Sure.

17:16.580 --> 17:18.480
Note: No Visitors

17:21.290 --> 17:22.250
See you later.

17:23.520 --> 17:24.120
Yeah.

17:29.890 --> 17:31.860
Ah! Yuuichi!

17:34.630 --> 17:35.670
Err...

17:37.870 --> 17:38.870
What is it?

17:39.270 --> 17:40.240
That book...

17:40.240 --> 17:41.570
You can read it now.

17:41.570 --> 17:42.570
Huh?

17:43.040 --> 17:46.040
But read it slowly, okay?

17:49.150 --> 17:49.810
Okay.

17:53.990 --> 17:55.650
It's finally that time.

17:55.650 --> 17:56.420
Yeah...

17:57.390 --> 18:00.430
What is Rika doing right now?

18:00.930 --> 18:04.430
She should be going into the operation room anytime now.

18:06.660 --> 18:08.670
Note: In Operation

18:54.680 --> 18:56.380
So this is where you are.

18:56.750 --> 18:58.720
Dinner is already over.

18:58.720 --> 18:59.950
Akiko-san!

18:59.950 --> 19:01.990
Is the operation supposed to take this long?

19:01.990 --> 19:03.190
Yeah.

19:03.190 --> 19:04.760
It will take a bit more time.

19:10.160 --> 19:11.000
Sorry.

19:11.430 --> 19:12.960
It was my fault.

19:12.960 --> 19:14.370
About what?

19:16.170 --> 19:19.340
When I went to your house last time...

19:19.340 --> 19:22.110
I took one of them...

19:22.110 --> 19:23.010
Huh?

19:24.840 --> 19:30.620
A picture, of you happily holding onto your dad's leg.

19:31.350 --> 19:34.550
I thought Rika would be happy if she saw it.

19:34.820 --> 19:37.120
So I took it with me.

19:37.120 --> 19:41.360
Rika, she kept looking at the picture and laughed.

19:41.890 --> 19:45.200
That's the first time I saw her so happy.

19:46.630 --> 19:48.600
What's so funny?

19:48.600 --> 19:49.900
It's nothing.

19:49.900 --> 19:51.940
Did something good happen?

19:51.940 --> 19:53.500
It's nothing.

19:54.770 --> 19:56.770
Rika has it even now.

19:57.940 --> 20:03.950
I sealed it in a sterile plastic bag and stuck it on her right leg where it won't interfere with the operation.

20:05.820 --> 20:08.050
She's using it as a safety charm.

20:11.360 --> 20:13.590
"What's your heart's desire?"

20:13.590 --> 20:14.960
"Imperviousness,

20:14.960 --> 20:15.990
lust,

20:15.990 --> 20:17.500
or romance?"

20:17.500 --> 20:19.260
"Well, at any rate..."

20:20.370 --> 20:22.170
"If you ask me,

20:22.170 --> 20:26.040
you belong in the third category."

20:26.040 --> 20:27.540
"This fits you best."

20:27.540 --> 20:30.210
"Please forgive my solemnness these past days."

20:31.080 --> 20:34.150
"But I've already started to change."

20:34.150 --> 20:36.710
"My friend. Are you in pain?"

20:36.710 --> 20:40.150
"We've always thought too deeply..."

20:44.020 --> 20:47.030
"Please don't fall into taking despicable actions..."

20:47.930 --> 20:50.130
"Run forward, into the storm."

20:50.830 --> 20:52.900
"Let us advance and face death."

20:53.730 --> 20:57.270
"Our love will always be about the rumors and panic..."

20:57.870 --> 20:59.640
"Let us prove that point!"

21:00.470 --> 21:01.540
"At the risk of my life,

21:01.540 --> 21:03.170
I'll become yours completely."

21:04.640 --> 21:05.740
Rika!

21:06.710 --> 21:07.980
"At the risk of my life,

21:07.980 --> 21:09.510
I'll become yours completely."

21:26.630 --> 21:28.370
Note: In Operation

21:44.820 --> 21:45.780
What?

21:45.780 --> 21:47.090
You're here...

21:47.090 --> 21:47.850
It's over.

21:47.850 --> 21:49.390
Umm...

21:49.390 --> 21:50.360
Rika...

21:50.760 --> 21:52.360
What happened to Rika?

21:53.290 --> 21:54.460
She's too weak...

21:54.460 --> 21:55.360
Huh?

21:55.360 --> 21:57.460
Her cardiac system was weak to begin with...

21:57.830 --> 22:00.670
Her father was like this too, so it was expected very early on...

22:01.130 --> 22:04.040
I've consulted related articles and had plans to counteract it...

22:04.940 --> 22:06.270
But Rika's condition is too serious...

22:06.740 --> 22:08.370
It's like a nightmare to surgeons.

22:09.310 --> 22:12.180
One cut leads to another trying to fix what was damaged by the last cut.

22:12.680 --> 22:13.950
Do you understand, Ezaki?

22:14.510 --> 22:16.580
It's like trying to sew a tofu back up!

22:16.910 --> 22:18.980
This is my first time seeing this kind of condition...

22:19.920 --> 22:20.820
Like a nightmare.

22:22.650 --> 22:23.620
Ezaki...

22:24.360 --> 22:25.590
Probably...

22:25.590 --> 22:27.930
This is probably the worst outcome for you.

22:39.340 --> 22:48.810
nee, yubisaki de anata wo kanjite

22:39.340 --> 22:48.810
Hey, I felt you with my fingers.

22:51.420 --> 23:00.960
nee, anata to miteita kono keshiki

22:51.420 --> 23:00.960
Hey, while seeing this view together.

23:04.460 --> 23:14.270
tsutawaru yasashisa ni mi wo yudanete

23:04.460 --> 23:14.270
And then I committed myself to your kindness.

23:14.270 --> 23:25.620
eien nado nai wakatte ita tsumori dayo

23:14.270 --> 23:25.620
I know nothing lasts forever.

23:28.820 --> 23:34.790
namae wo yobu anata no koe wo

23:28.820 --> 23:40.770
I will keep your voice, which calls my name, in the bottom of my heart,

23:34.790 --> 23:40.770
mune no oku ni shimatte oku kara

23:40.770 --> 23:46.870
hirakareta tobira no mukou gawa de

23:40.770 --> 23:46.870
On the other side of the open door,

23:46.870 --> 23:54.080
koborenu youni kienai youni

23:46.870 --> 23:54.080
That it won't overflow, it won't disappear.

24:02.120 --> 24:07.690
Next Episode

24:03.620 --> 24:05.020
The only thing left...

24:05.020 --> 24:06.860
is the empty excuse of hope.

24:07.290 --> 24:08.990
Buried deep down however...

24:08.990 --> 24:11.130
is the hopeless reality.

24:11.860 --> 24:13.830
A person as weak as me...

24:13.830 --> 24:15.600
cannot change anything.

24:16.070 --> 24:18.300
But I don't want to give up...

24:18.740 --> 24:19.840
I can't give up!

24:20.470 --> 24:21.670
That's why I'll give up...

24:22.240 --> 24:23.680
for never giving up.

24:24.180 --> 24:24.740
Yeah.

24:25.210 --> 24:26.310
Even like that, I...

24:27.010 --> 24:27.750
Next time:

24:27.750 --> 24:31.020
Looking up at the Half Moon: Our Hands Will...

24:29.480 --> 24:32.150
Our Hands Will
